00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:35.735
Yeah, I think this

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:36.736
this court filing,

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:37.937
the messages contained in it

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.739
really expose Fox News

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:42.409
as frankly a propaganda machine

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:43.943
