00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.872
In fact, in one case,

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:14.941
one of the Fox News correspondents,

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:15.642
Jacqui Heinrich,

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:16.910
the White House correspondent,

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:18.812
Fact-Checked, a tweet from Trump

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:20.680
