00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:28.321
checking for

00:01:28.321 --> 00:01:29.656
doing her job as a reporter

00:01:29.656 --> 00:01:31.257
when you're supposed to report the truth

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:32.559
and put only the facts out there.

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:33.860
That's precisely right.

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:35.161
And she she wasn't fired.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:36.362
She's still at the network.

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:38.264
But that tweet that she did post

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:38.832
Fact-Checking,

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:41.034
